[Retroactive note added later, per the Symptom/Ruled out/Root cause/Fix commit-message framework]

Symptom (reasoned from the existing iCloud-relocation gotcha's pattern):
detecting the installer download by file size alone assumed that a file
matching the ~4.7GB size window was necessarily finished.

Root cause: a file could still be actively growing toward a larger final
size while passing through that size window, or the browser could still
be flushing the last bit to disk.

Fix: added a check/wait/recheck step (stat size twice, 5s apart) before
treating the candidate as done — the same pattern already used for the
iCloud-relocation gotcha elsewhere in this skill.
